{"type": "say", "text": "Alright everyone, let's get this load-and-vehicle confirmation done before I publish the dispatch plan. We've got two loads ready at the forward logistics point: four pallets of temperature-sensitive clinic supplies and six pallets of generator repair parts. The normal assignment puts the clinic supplies on Truck 18 and the generator parts on Truck 12, with the receiving compound three hours out. I need the distribution NCO and motor transport warrant officer to confirm vehicle status and cargo compatibility right now. Specifically, I need to know: Are both Truck 12 and Truck 18 operational? Are the powered cargo inverters on both trucks functioning? And can each truck carry its assigned load? Let's hear it."}
```

