{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Capt. Morgan, I need to flag a time constraint: I confirmed this morning that the receiving clinic has an exact 0930-1000 appointment for the temperature-sensitive supplies. With a three-hour transit time, the convoy must depart no later than 0630 to make that appointment. This appointment hasn't been entered on the movement board yet, so it's not reflected in the current plan."}
```

